    <p>Despite significant advances in medical and assistive technologies, many individuals with disabilities continue to face barriers in accessing education, employment, healthcare, and social participation. This project aims to develop and test innovative, inclusive solutions that improve the quality of life by focusing on user-centered design, community engagement, and policy integration.</p>

